%% TOBI - overall system architecture (canonical). Flowchart-only subset (#20 Architecture V2).
%% Rewritten for #21 Mission Control Infrastructure V2: every surface now enters one engine.
%% Edit this file to change the rendered Overall TOBI diagram; the runtime validates it on load.
flowchart TD
  Owner[Owner] --> MC[Mission Control web app]
  Owner --> TG[Telegram bot]
  Owner --> CLI[TOBI CLI and terminal]
  Sched[Scheduler jobs] --> Adapter

  MC --> DashAPI[Mission Control FastAPI 8090]
  TG --> TelegramAdapter[core telegram_bot]
  CLI --> Main[main.py]
  Main --> Sched
  Main --> PublicAPI[External API 8000]

  DashAPI --> Gateway[Runtime gateway]
  TelegramAdapter --> Adapter[Surface adapter]
  DashAPI --> Adapter
  Main --> Adapter
  DashAPI --> DevControl[Coding Agent control plane]

  subgraph Runtime["Runtime V2 - one engine behind every request"]
    Gateway --> Rollout[Rollout controls and rollback]
    Gateway --> Run[Canonical run]
    Adapter --> Run
    Run --> History[Ordered run history, redacted]
    Run --> Steps[Leased steps and checkpoints]
    Run --> Policy[Policy, approvals, budgets]
    Policy --> Catalog[Tool catalog and validation]
    Catalog --> Receipts[Action receipts, applied once]
    Run --> Trace[Traces and quality gates]
  end

  Gateway --> Conductor[Conductor facade]
  Conductor --> Brain[Brain and Graph context]
  Conductor --> Models[Model router and fallbacks]
  Catalog --> Tools[Read and action tools]

  Tools --> Projects[Projects, tasks, goals, resources]
  Tools --> Terminal[Terminal engine]
  Tools --> Integrations[Connected services]
  Tools --> MCP[MCP and A2A]
  Tools --> Engines[Research, execution, CEO, Explore]

  Trace --> RunsPage[Runs page and health checks]
  Rollout --> RunsPage

  Brain --> SQLite[(SQLite)]
  History --> SQLite
  Steps --> SQLite
  Receipts --> SQLite
  Projects --> SQLite
  Projects --> Files[(Project resource files)]
  Models --> Providers[LLM providers]
  Integrations --> External[External APIs]

  DevControl --> Run
  DevControl --> DevDB[(Development ledger)]
  DevControl --> Worktrees[(Isolated Git worktrees)]
  DevControl --> RunnerQueue[Durable runner queue]
  RunnerQueue --> RunnerService[Supervised coding runner]
  RunnerService --> CodingCLIs[Codex and OpenCode CLIs]

  Main --> Hermes[Hermes state and skills]
  Brain --> Hermes
  Models --> Hermes
